        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Self-assembly of 2-aldehyde-8-hydroxyquinoline (ahq), histamine dihydrochloride, triethylamine and Nd(OAc)3·6H2O. Nd(OAc)3·6H2O (0.129 g, 0.3 mmol), ahq (0.017 g, 0.1 mmol), histamine dihydrochloride (0.018 g, 0.1 mmol) and triethylamine (0.010 g, 0.1 mmol) were dissolved in CH3OH/CH2Cl2 (5/10 mL, v/v). Diethyl ether was allowed to diffuse slowly into the filtrate. Crystals of 1a suitable for single-crystal X-ray analysis were obtained in 9 days. Hnma is generated in situ by condensation of ahq and histamine.",
